DERIVED WORK — PROVENANCE NOTE

The crates in this family (ifc-core, ifc-cli, ifc-wasm and, where
present, ifc-capi) started life as the standalone ifc2glb project by the same author,
developed separately and imported into this repository on 2026-08-20, when the
converter workspaces were folded into rust_src/ and the crates were renamed
(dropping the "2glb" suffix, since they now cook straight to .tdp as well as GLB).

IFC geometry comes from the ifc-lite kernel
(https://github.com/LTplus-AG/ifc-lite), pulled in as a dependency under
its own licence.

The original licence below is unchanged and continues to govern this code.

